  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrowhead slices through flesh, fat and muscle, penetrating into your abdominal cavity. Fortunately its force was then spent and it failed to lacerate any of the organs there. Still, that’s an infection waiting to happen!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). Pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test or go @Condition[Prone]. You also must pass a <strong>Hard (-20) Endurance</strong> Test or contract a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.kKccDTGzWzSXCBOb]{Festering Wound}. </p><p>Extraction will be <strong>Difficult (-10),</strong> and as long as the arrow remains you’ll suffer a penalty of -10 to any Endurance Tests required by the Infection.</p>"
    },
